wn features freely. They can disguise themselves as someone else."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...SOP-II scrambles over and plays around with the Doll's face."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635-NoArmor","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Of course, this model is strictly prohibited, but I'm guessing our informant used it as a stand-in for himself."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod-Noarmor","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"For real...? That's really scary. Who'd have thought such Dolls actually exist? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"And how do you know about them...?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635-NoArmor","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I've read files about this particular model, but this is the first time I've actually seen one. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"This kind of Doll is insanely expensive... They were originally created for entertainment purposes, but were banned after one took part in a political crime. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I'm surprised this guy even managed to get his hands on one... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Still, if it's a Doll lying here, then..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod-Noarmor","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hmm...then the real informant is actually safe at the moment?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635-NoArmor","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"He disguised the Doll as himself, pulled a switcheroo, then slipped away. But the body hasn't been removed, which means the people after him probably als